      /\ ( A e. CC /\ A =/= 0 ) ) )
  11 divne0 |- ( ( ( B e. CC /\ B =/= 0 ) /\ ( A e. CC /\ A =/= 0 ) ) -> ( B / A ) =/= 0 )
